      "side": 1,
      "message": "BTW it seems we can change cpuid_entry_is_empty() to check if all 4 regs eax, ebx, ecx, edx are zero, not just eax? And thus easily avoid regressing such VMMs that set CPUID with max_standard_function\u003d0 but a non-empty vendor string?",
